{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
How long must [C#]I carry [B]worries with[D#m]in me
With grief [C#]in my heart all the [B]day
[D#m]Look at me and [C#]answer, LORD my [B]God
Give [G#m]light to [C#]my eyes before I [D#m]fade
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
But I [B]trust in your [C#]steadfast [D#m]love
